## User

Shift every lowercase letter forward by n places in the alphabet, wrapping from z to a; leave every other character unchanged.

## Context

```haskell
ord :: Char -> Int
chr :: Int -> Char
isLower :: Char -> Bool
```

## Type

type
```haskell
caesar :: Int -> String -> String
```

## Term

```haskell
caesar n = map (chr . ord) . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower . map chr . filter isLower
```

